<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amos</book>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="mt">Amos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Uzzia vaihawm lai leh Israel kumpipa Joas tapa Jeroboam vaihawm lai a zinling ma kum nih in, Tekoa mun ganhon vengmite lak a mi Amos thu Israel tungtang a muh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan aman, “Toupa Zion tang a kipan a humham ding a, Jerusalem a kipan in a aw a suah ding a; belam vengmite gantatna munte a lungkham ding ua, Karmel tangvum a vuai ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Damaska khaw tatlekna thumte ziak in ahi, lite ziak in, a gawtna ka daisak kei ding; Gilead gam buhgawina sikte a a gawi ziak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh Hazael inn ah mei ka sawl ding a, Benhadad kumpipa innte a kang khin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan Damaska khaw kongkhak sik ka hihtan ding a, Aven guam a kipan a luahmite leh Eden inn a kipan kumpipa chiang tawipa ka mangsak ding a; Suria gam mite Kir gam ah sal in a om ding uh,” Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Gaza khaw tatlekna thumte ziak in, ahi, lite ziak in, a gawtna ka hihtawp kei ding; Edom kiang a piak ding in mi tengteng sal a a pi ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Gaza kulh tung ah mei ka sawl ding a, a kumpipa innte a kang khin ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Ashdod khua a kipan a luahmi leh Askelon kua a kipan kumpipa chiang tawimi ka hihmang ding a; huan, Ekron khaw tung ah ka khut ka lik ding a, Philistia mi omlaite a mang ding uh,” Toupa Pathian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, “Tura khaw tatlekna thumte ziak in, ahi, lite ziak in, a gawtna ka daisak kei ding; Edom kiang a mi tengteng a piak ua, unau tung a a thukhun a theihgige louh ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh Tura khaw kulhtungah mei ka sawl ding a, a kumpipa innte a kang khin ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Edomtatlekna thumte ziak in, ahi, lite ziak in, gawtna ka daisak kei ding; a unau namsau in a delh a, a hehpihna tengteng a paimang a, a hehna in a botkek gige a, tangtawn a a hehna a vom nilouh ziak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh Teman tung ah mei ka sawl ding a, Bozrah khaw kumpipa innte a kang khin ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Ammon tate tatlekna thumte ziak in ahi, lite ziak in a gawtna ka daisak kei ding; a gam uh a zatsak theihna ding un, Gilead khaw numei naupaite a kuihkek ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh Rabah khaw kulh tung ah mei ka mut kuang ding a, huan, kidouna ni a kikou toh, pingpei ni a huihpi toh, a kumpipa innte a kangkhin ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kumpipa uh sal in a man ding ua, a miliante toh kiton in” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Moab tatlekna thumte ziak in, ahi, lite ziak in, a gawtna ka daisak kei ding; Edom kumpipa guhte sunu bang zen a a hal ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh Moab tung ah mei ka sawl ding a, Kerioth khaw kumpipa guhte a kangkhin ding; huan Moab buaina leh kikou leh pengkul ging in a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai lak a kipan vaihawmmi ka hihmang ding a, a miliante tengteng, amah toh ka that ding” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Judah tatlekna thumte ziak in, ahi, lite ziak in, a gawtna ka daisak kei ding; Toupa dan a deihkei ua, a thupiakte a zuikei uh, a pate uh chih sek a zuaugente un amau a pimang ziak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Judah tung ah mei ka sawl ding a, Jerusalem khaw kumpipa innte a kangkhin ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Israel tatlekna thumte ziak in, ahi, lite ziak in, a gawtna ka daisak kei ding; dangkasik a mi diktat a zuak uleh khedap but khat a mi tasam a zuak ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gentheite leivui bang a sikden ut tuntun a, mizawngte vaihawmna a kaikawi uhi: huan, mi khat leh a pa nungak khat kiang ah ka min hihnin ding in a hoh zel uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maitam tengteng kiang chin a khamna puanphah tung ah a lumzel ua, a Pathian uh inn a mi a liausak mante un uain a dawn zel uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Himahleh amau ma ah Amorte, Sidar bang a sang leh tosaw bang a khauh leng ka hihmang a; tunglam a kipan a gah leh nuailam a kipan a zung leng ka hihmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan Amorte gam nei ding in Aigupta gam a kipan in k’on pikhia a, gamdai ah kum sawmli sung ka honpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan zawlnei hi ding in na tapate uh lak a mi leh Nazarit te hi ding in na tangvalte uh lak a mi ka bawl a, Aw Israel tate aw, huchibang in ahi ka hia? Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh Nazarit mite kiang ah uain dawn ding na pia ua, zawlneite kiang ah, thu genkei un, chi in thu na pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, kangtalai a buhphal sawnsip bang in, na mun uah k’on sawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan mi taihatte hatna a mang ding a, mi hat in tha a suah thei sam kei ding hi; mi hat mahmah leng a kihumbit theikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thalpeu zangmi leng ading thei sam kei ding; paihat theimi leng a kihumbit theikei ding, sakol tungtuang mi leng a kihumbit theikei ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in mi thilhihthei mahmah lak a mi hangsan leng vuaktang in a taimang ding uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Israel tate aw, Aigupta gam a kipan a k’on pikhiak inkawte aw, Toupa’n hichibang a nou a hondemna thu ngaikhia un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Noute kia khovel a inkuan tengteng a ka theih na hi ua: huaiziak in na thulimlouhna tengteng uah k’on gawt ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sawm kei un mi nih a paikhawm ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Humpinelkai in gammang a sa a matlai louh ngal in, a humham ngei ahia? Humpinelkai lunlai in bangmah a matkei leh a kawhawm sung a kipan a humham ngei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah ding a tah a omkei leh, vasa leitung a thang ah a awk thei ahia? Thang pen bangmah awk lou in lei a kipan in a kisai dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khopi ah mi launa lou ah pengkul a mut ding ua hia? Toupa hih louh in khopi ah hoihlouhna a hongom dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Diktak in Toupa Pathian in a nasemmi, a zawlneite kiang ah a thuguk hilhlou in bangmah ahihkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Humpinelkai a humham a, kua a laulou ding? Toupa Pathian in thu a gen a, kuan a genlou thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ashdod khaw kumpipa innte leh Aigupta gam kumpipa innte ah gen unla, “Samaria tang tungte ah kikhawm unla, huai a buaina liantak omte leh huai lak a simmohna omte en un” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A kumpipa uh innte a, hiamgamna leh kisuamna koihkhawm mite’n lah hihdik dan a siam ngal kei ua” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Gam kimvel in melma a omlai ding a: na hatna na kiang a kipan a lakhe ding a, na kumpipa innte a hihse ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi; “Belampu in humpinelkai kam a kipan a khe nih hiam, bil them hiam, a honkhia bang in, huchibang in Samaria khua a teng Israelte lupna ning leh lupna maimom puanphan lukham them toh hutkhiak in om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai unla, Jakob inkawte tung ah theisak un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel tatleknate amah tung ah ka gawt leh, huai ni chiang in, Bethel khua a maitamte leng ka gawt ngal dia; maitam kite a tansum ding ua, lei ah a ke ding uhi” sepaihte Pathian, Toupa Pathian in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Huan phalbi leh nipi inn ka satse ding a; saiha innte a mangthang ding a, inn thupite’n tawpna a nei ding uh” Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nou Bashan bawngpite, Samaria tangtung a om a, genthei simmoha, tasamte nuaisiaha, a toupate uh kiang a, “Honla unla i dawn ding uh,” chite aw, hiai thu za un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in amah siangthouna lou in a kichiam a; “Ngai dih ua, sikkuaika a nou a hon lakmang a, na lak ua omsun ngakuai a a hon lakmang ni a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan awngvang ah na paisuak ding ua, michih tangtak in a pai ding uh; Harmon mun ah nou leh nou na kipai ding uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bethel ah hong unla, talek un; Gilgal ah hong unla, tatlekna pungsak un; huan, na kithoihnate uh zingsang teng in honla unla, na sawm ua khatte uh ni khat hal zel in honla un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan silngou pang kipahthu gen kithoihna lan unla, amau deihdan a lante hilh unla, phuang un; Aw Israel tate aw, hiai lah na deih ngal ua” Toupa Pathian in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Huan ken leng na khopi tengteng uah hasianna leh na mun tengteng uah taksapna k’on pia a; huchi in leng ka kiang ah na hongkik kei uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Buhlak hun ding kha thum a hihlai in na tung ua vuahzu ding leng ka len a; khopi khat tung a ka zuksak in, khopi dang tung ah ka zusak kei hi; mun khat tung ah ka zusak sek a, a zuk louhna mun a keu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in khopi nih leh thum ah tui dawn ding zong in a taikhawm ua, a taikei uh: huchi in leng ka kiang ah na hongkik kei uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Keuna leh apna in k’on gawt a; na huante uh, na grephuante uh, na theipi kungte uh, na olive singkungte uh singnget lungin a nekhin vekta hi: huchi in leng ka kiang ah na hongkik kei uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aigupta gam bang in na lak uah huihpi ka sawl a; namsau in na tangvalte uh ka that a, na sakolte uh ka pimang a; na giahphualte uh gim namsia na nak ua nam khop in k’on omsak a: huchi in leng ka kiang ah na hong kikkei uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sodom leh Gomorrah khua Pathian in a chipsak lai bang in, na lak uah mi khenkhat ka hihchim a, singkang lakkhiak bang na hi ua: huchi in leng ka kiang ah na hongkik kei uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in, “Aw Israel, na tung ah hichibang in ka hih ding: na tung a hiai ka hih ding ziak in, Aw Israel, na Pathian tuak ding in mansa in om in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai in, tangte dingkhe sak a, huih bawl a, mihing kiang a a ngaihtuahna bang ahia chih genkhiak sak a, zingsang mialsak a, leimun sangte chilpa a min Toupa , sepaihte Pathian ahi!”
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel inkawte aw, hiai thu noute sunna ding ka gen za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nungak, Israel, a pukta hi; a ding nawn kei ding: a gam tung ah paihkhiak ahita hi; amah tungding ding in kuamah a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n in hichi in a chi hi: Israel chite kiang ah, khopi, sang pawtna in, za a nuse ding a, khopi, za pawtna in, sawm a nuse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel inkawte kiang ah hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hon zong un, na hing ding uh: himahleh Bethel khua zong kei unla, Gilgal ah lut sam kei unla, Beer–sheba khua ah galkah kei un: Gilgal khua pellou in sal in a man ding a, Bethel khua a hong vuaksuak ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa zong unla, na hing ding uh; huchilou in zaw Joseph inn ah mei bang in a pawt ding a, a kangkhin ding a, Bethel khua ah mitsak ding kuamah a omkei ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaihawmna singkha suaksak a, diktatna lei a paikhete aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siguk leh Zuheisuktun bawlpa leh sihna limliap lak a tangsakpa leh sun zan mial a bawlpa, tuipi tuite sam a, leitung a luangsakpa, amah tak zong le uchin; a min Toupa ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulh tung a manthatna hong tungguih zou hial a, mihatte tung a manthatna tungsakpa pen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kongpi ah taihilhmi a mudah ua, thudiktak genmi a kih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in mi gentheite tuan den in buh na laksak ua: suangsek in innte na lam ua, himahleh asung ah na teng kei ding uh. Grep huan nuamte na bawl ua, himahleh uain na dawn kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tatleknate uh tamdan leh na khelhnate uh a thupidan lah ka thei ngal a; mi diktatte na simmawh ua, golhna la a, kongpi a tasamte a hih ding him ua pampaihte aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in hun hoihlou a hih ziak in mi pil zaw huai hun chiang in a daidide ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na hin theihna ding un hoihlouhna zong lou in, hoihna zong unla: huan na gen bang un, Toupa sepaihte Pathian na kiang uah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khelhna hua unla, hoihna it un: kongpi ah vaihawmna kiptak in tung ding un: Joseph inkaw omsunte tung ah Toupa , sepaihte Pathian in hehpihna a nei kha mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa , sepaihte Pathian, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Kongzing teng ah nakpi a kahna a om ding a, lamliante tengteng ah, khawk hina mah e: a chi ding uhi; lungkham ding in louneimite leh nakpi a kap ding in sisunsiamte a sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Grephuan teng ah nakpi a kahna a om ding a: na lak uah ka paisuak ding” Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa ni deihte aw, na tung uh a gik hi: Bangdia Toupa ni deih na hia ua? Vak hilou in mial ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Humpinelkai taisan a, vompi tuakmi bang leh inn a lut a, bang tung a khut nga a gul in a tuk bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa ni vak hilou in mial ahi sin ka hia? Mial sah leh vakna neilou in?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Na ankuangluite uh ka hua in ka musit a, na kikhawmpi pisuakte uah leng ka kipak sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi, na thillat uleh na buhlat uh honlan mahle uchin, ka sang kei ding a, na gan thau uh lemna thillatte leng ka limsak kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na kaihging ging kilawm uh ka ngaikhe kei ding; huaiziak in kei a kipan bil aphuai na late uh lamang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh vaihawmna bel tuite bang in leh diktatna lui lian bang in luang hen” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Aw Israel inkawte aw, kum sawmli sung in gamdai ah kithoihnate leh thillatte ka kiang ah na honlan ngei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi, Molok na milim pathian uh leh Kaiuan na milimte uh, na aksi pathian uh, nou dia na tawisang zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa a min sepaihte Pathian in, noute Damaska khokhen ah sal in k’on paisak ding” Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion tang a nuam lua a omte leh Samaria tang a bittak a omte leh Israel nam lian lak a inkuan mi thupite tung a gik hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kalneh khua ah hoh unla, en un; huai a kipan in Hamath khaw thupi ah hoh unla: Philistia gam Gath khua ah paisuk unla: hiai gamte sang in noute na hoihzaw uhia? Nou gam sang in a gam uh a zazaw ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou ni hoihlou gamlapi a koih leh hiamgam tunna naihsakte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saiha lupna a lum a, a tutphah sau tungte ua kizia a, belamhon lak a belamnoute leh bawnghonte lak a kipan bawng tuaite ne a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David bang a kaihging tumtum a, lasak ding na bawlbawl uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Belhbu lian a uain dawn a, sathau hoihpen a kinuhte mah; himahleh Joseph haksatna ziak in a lungkham kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in tua sal dia pai masate toh sal in a pai ding ua, nuamsa a kiziate nuamsakna lakmang in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa , sepaihte Pathian, Toupa Pathian in amah leh amah kilou in a kichiam a; “Jakob kisaktheihna ka kih a, a kumpipa innte ka mudah a: huaiziak in khua leh asung a om tengteng ka mansak sin ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichi a honghi ding a, inn khat mi sawm a om leh a sivek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan misite gang, amaute halpa ngei in inn sung a kipan a a guh lakhe ding in, inn sungtawng pen a mi om kiang ah, “Na kiang ah kuapeuh a damlai a om uhia?” a chih a, aman, “Omlou” a chih leh; aman, “Dai sipsip in! Toupa min i lou ding uh ahi ngalkei a” a chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Toupa’n thu a peta hi; inn lian a chim lemlum ding a, inn neu leng a khang kham ik iak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sakolte suangpi tung ah a tai ding ua hia? Huai ah min bawng in lei a let ding ua hia? Noute’n vaihawmna lah gu na suaksak ua diktatna gah singkha na suaksak uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou thil bangmahlou tung a kipak a, i hatna in ahi kei maw kite i lak ua? chite aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“En dih ua, Aw Israel inkawte aw, nou hondou ding in nam ka ding khesak ding a; huan Hamath khomual a kipan in Arabah luitan in nou a hon engbawl ding uh” Toupa , sepaihte Pathian in a chita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchibang in Toupa Pathian in a hon ensak a; en dih ua, hai poi nanung zaw pen dot pattungna a khaukhup a bawl a; ngai dih ua, kumpipa tangseu khit a pou nanung zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan huchi a honghi a, huai gam a loupa a nek khitnung un, “Aw Toupa Pathian, ngaidam in, k’on ngen hi: Jakob bangchi’n ading thei dia? Amah lah a neu ngal a” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai thu ah Toupa’n a lung hei in: “ Toupa’n , hiai hongtung nawn kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchibang in, Toupa Pathian in a hon ensak a; huan en dih ua, Toupa Pathian mei a dou ding in a sam a; mei in tuithuk lian a kangkhin a, gam leng kat a utlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ken, “Aw Toupa Pathian, khawl in k’on ngen ahi: Jakob bangchi’n ading thei dia? Amah lah a neu ngal a” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai thu ah Toupa’n a lungsim hei in; “ Toupa Pathian in, huai leng a hongtung nawn kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichibang in a hon ensak a: ngai dih ua, Toupa bel ulum a bawl bang kiang ah ading a, a khut a ulum toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan ka kiang ah Toupa’n “Amos, bang na mu a?” a chi a. Ken, “Ulum” ka chi hi. Toupa’n , “Ngai in, ka mi, Israelte lak ah ulum ka koih ding a; amau ka paikheng nawnta kei ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isak mun sangte a hong segawp ding a, Israel mun siangthoute hihsiat ahi ding ua: Jeroboam inkawte namsau in ka dou ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan Bethel khaw siampu Amaziah in Israel kumpipa Jeroboam kiang ah: “Amos in Israel inkawte lak ah nang hon kalh a: gam in a thu tengteng a thuak theikei chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amos in lah hichi in a chi ngal a, “Jeroboam namsau in a si ding, pellou in a gam a kipan in Israel sal in a pikhe ding” chi in thu a khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Amos kiang ah Amaziah in, “Aw nang zawlnei, kuan inla, Judah gam ah taimang inla, huai ah an ne inla, thu hilh in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Bethel khua ah thuhilh nawn ken: kumpipa Mun Siangthou leh kumpipa in a hih ziak in” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan Amaziah kiang ah Amos in, “Zawlnei ka hi kei a, zawlnei tapa leng ka hi sam kei; ganhon vengpa leh theipi sing kempa ka hi zaw hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, kuan inla, ka mi Israelte kiang ah thu gen in, honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in tuin Toupa thu za in: Nang Israel kalh in thu gen kenla, Isak inkawte kalh in thu khak ken na chih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Na zi khopi ah kizuaknu ahi ding a, na tapate, na tanute namsau in a puk ding ua, na gam tehna khau in a hawm ding ua; nang leng sianglou mun ah na si ding a; pellou in Israel a gam a kipan sal in a pimang ding uh a chi” chi in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichibang in Toupa Pathian in a hon ensak a; en dih ua, nipi theibawm na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman “Amos, bang ahia na muh?” a chi a. Ken Nipi theibawm, ka chi hi. Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Ka mi Israelte tung ah tawpna a hongtungta; amaute gawtna ding ah ka lungsim ka kheng nawn kei ding hi chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in, huai ni chiang in biakin a lasakte dahla ahi ding a; munchih ah siluang tampi om ding a, daidide in a paikhe ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai ngaikhia in, Aw tasamte nebei nuam a; gam a migentheite hihmang nuamte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Buh ka zuak theihna ding un kha thak chikchiang a bei ding a, tangbuang buh ka zuak theihna ding ua khawlni chikchiang a bei hiam, chi in; Ephah hihneu a sekel hihlian, diklou pia bukna khemna in na zang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dangkasik a mi genthei lei a, mi tasamte khedap but khat a lei a, buhsi i zuak theihna ding in” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa , Jakob thupina lou in a kichiam a, “Pellou in a nasep himhim ka mangngilh hetkei ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai ziak in gam pumpi ling in asung a om peuhmahte a lungkham kei ding ua hia? Ahi, tuilian bang in a hong khangvek ding a; Aigupta gam lui bang in a hong buai in a kiam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa Pathian in, huai ni chiang in, hichi a honghi ding a, sunlai in ni ka tumsak ding a, nisat lai in lei ka mialsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na ankuangluite uh lungkhamna leh na la tengteng uh kahna ka suaksak ding a; kawng tengteng saiip puan ka tengsak ding a, lu chih sip ah giauna k’on tungsak ding; tapa tang neih sunna ding in lungkhamna leh, a tawpna khatna ni bang in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Toupa Pathian in, Ngai dih ua, nite a hongtung lellel; huai ni chiang in gam ah kial ka sawl ding a, an kialna hilou in, tui a kialna hi sam lou in, Toupa thu theihna kialna pen a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan tuipi a kipan in tuipi ah leh mal a kipan suahlam ah leng a vakvai ding ua; Toupa thu zong ding in ning chih ah a tai ding ua, a mu kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in nungak siangthou leh tangvalte dangtak in a bah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria khaw khelhna lou a kichiam a, ‘Aw Dan, na Pathian a hing bang in’ leh ‘Beer–sheba khaw lampi a hing bang in’ chi, huai mite leng a puk ding ua, a thounawn hetkei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maitam chin a Toupa ding in ka mu a: aman kongpi bulte a lin theihna ding ua a lu bawkte uh khen inla, avek ua lu tung ah hihzan vek in: ken a sibangte namsau in ka that ding a; khat lel leng a taimang kei ding uhi, khat lel leng a suakta hetkei ding uh a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Misi khua pha in paisuak mahle uh, huai a kipan in ka khut in ka lakhe ding a; van ah kaltou mahle uh huai a kipan ka kaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Karmel mual vum ah bu mahle uh ka zong ding a, huai a kipan amau ka lasuk ding a, tuipi taw ah ka mitmuh louh in bu mahle uh, huai a kipan gul thu ka pe ding a amau a tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A melmate uh ma ah sal in pai mahle uh, huai a kipan namsau thu ka pe ding a, amau a satlum ding ua: hoihna hilou in, hoihlouhna ding in a tung uah ka mit ka nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gam khoih a, zulsakpa Toupa , sepaihte Pathian ahi ngal a; huailai a omte tengteng a lungkham ding ua; luipi bang in a khang ding ua, Aigupta lui bang in a kiam nawn ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van a a dantante bawl a, leitung a a dantan kual bawl a, tuipi tuite sam a, leitung asung bawpa, a min Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n “Aw Israel tate aw, ka tung ah Ethiopia tate bang in na omkei ding ua hia? Aigupta gam a kipan Israel leh Kaphtor gam a kipan Philistia mite leh Kir gam a kipan Suria mite ka pikhe ka hia? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n , Ngai dih ua, Toupa Pathian mit gam gilou tung ah a tu a, leitung a kipan ka hihmang ding a; himahleh Jakob inkawte a hihse vek kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngai dih ua, thu ka pe ding ahi; hakvang a buh a haih bang un, Israel inkawte nam tengteng lak ah ka haih ding a; himahleh tang neupen leng leitung ah a ke kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Ka mite mikhial tengteng, hoihlouhna in a hon delhpha kei ding a, honpha sam kei ding’ chite namsau in a si ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa , hiai thil hihpan, “Huai ni chiang in David bawkta chim ka tungding ding a, a awngvangte ka hu ding a; a siate ka lemtou ding a, nidanglai a a om bang in ka lam thak ding hi chi in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom mun a omlaite leh ka min a sap nam tengtengte a neih theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n , “Ngai dih ua, nite a hongtung lellel ahi” huai ni chiang in leiletmi in buh atmi a delhpha ding a, grep chilmi’n chithehmi a delhpha ding a; tangsang in uain khum a taksak ding; tang tengteng a zul ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan ka mi Israelte sal a kipan ka pikik nawn ding a; khua kigawpsate a bawl nawn ding ua, a luah ding uhi; huan grephuante a bawl ding ua, a uain a dawn ding uh; huante leng a bawl ding ua, a gah a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gam uah amau ka phutkip ding a, a kiang ua ka piak a gam ua kipan bohkhiak in a om nawnta kei ding, Toupa na Pathian in a chi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
